tralia and Canada), with the home team and Australia having the exact same goal difference (9-7). Under current rules, the Australian win over the US (3-1) would have given third place to the Australians, but in 1984, the tie was resolved by a penalty shootout. This was conducted some 15 minutes after the final match. The Americans won it, 10-5."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button323211", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button323211').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:data-toggle "tooltip", :data-placement "right", :data-original-title "Games Played", :class "split", :style "display: none"} "GP"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Goals"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Field Goals"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Penalty Corner Goals"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Penalty Stroke Goals"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Green Cards"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Yellow Cards"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Red Cards"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {:class "accordion-toggle", :data-toggle "collapse", :data-target ".team-members-525222"} [:div {:class "glyphicon glyphicon-plus"}]] [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "–"] [:td {} "Netherlands"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NED"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NED.png"}] "NED"]] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "–"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "–"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "–"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "–"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "–"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "–"] [:td {:class "split", :style "display: none"} "–"] [:td {:class "split",